    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a lost brick phone, dropped deep into a sewer. With nothing but your own torque and rotation, flip and launch yourself upward. One wrong move can cost you everything.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a world of nostalgic games, strange characters, and hidden secrets as you fight your way back to the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/6b8e141d448f71cda6064b5c668ff644.poster.avif?t=1755148468\" width=540 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/6b8e141d448f71cda6064b5c668ff644.webm?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/6b8e141d448f71cda6064b5c668ff644.mp4?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip to Climb</strong> \u2013 Use only your phone\u2019s rotation to move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 7 Worlds</strong> \u2013 Each world is full of old toys, broken gadgets, and fun surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Nostalgic Games</strong> \u2013 Find, unlock and play classics like Snake, Flappy Bird, and Bounce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Simple controls with tough, physics-based gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to NPCs</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky characters and uncover weird lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Phone</strong> \u2013 Unlock new phone styles and colors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2757 <strong>WARNING!\u00a0\u2757</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Most players quit.</strong> Not because it\u2019s hard but because they can't stay calm.\u00a0Falling isn\u2019t failure. Quitting is. <strong>Prove you\u2019re different.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/c2532d4dd19c8ae34d3d256ae82fa77a.poster.avif?t=1755148468\" width=540 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/c2532d4dd19c8ae34d3d256ae82fa77a.webm?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/c2532d4dd19c8ae34d3d256ae82fa77a.mp4?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a lost brick phone, dropped deep into a sewer. With nothing but your own torque and rotation, flip and launch yourself upward. One wrong move can cost you everything.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a world of nostalgic games, strange characters, and hidden secrets as you fight your way back to the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/6b8e141d448f71cda6064b5c668ff644.poster.avif?t=1755148468\" width=540 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/6b8e141d448f71cda6064b5c668ff644.webm?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/6b8e141d448f71cda6064b5c668ff644.mp4?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip to Climb</strong> \u2013 Use only your phone\u2019s rotation to move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 7 Worlds</strong> \u2013 Each world is full of old toys, broken gadgets, and fun surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Nostalgic Games</strong> \u2013 Find, unlock and play classics like Snake, Flappy Bird, and Bounce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Simple controls with tough, physics-based gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to NPCs</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky characters and uncover weird lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Phone</strong> \u2013 Unlock new phone styles and colors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2757 <strong>WARNING!\u00a0\u2757</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Most players quit.</strong> Not because it\u2019s hard but because they can't stay calm.\u00a0Falling isn\u2019t failure. Quitting is. <strong>Prove you\u2019re different.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/c2532d4dd19c8ae34d3d256ae82fa77a.poster.avif?t=1755148468\" width=540 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/c2532d4dd19c8ae34d3d256ae82fa77a.webm?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/c2532d4dd19c8ae34d3d256ae82fa77a.mp4?t=1755148468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
